Suppose:

EC2 private IP = 10.0.2.15
Application = running on port 8080
ALB = port 80

The request goes:

Browser
   ↓
ALB :80
   ↓
Target Group
   ↓
EC2 10.0.2.15:8080
   ↓
Application

The Target Group is the connection between the Load Balancer and EC2.


